# Google Maps Platform key. Create at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#
# Enable these APIs on the project, and restrict the key to them:
#   Geocoding API          — locating addresses
#   Address Validation API — confirming an address is real and deliverable
#   Places API (New)       — schools, parks, playgrounds, childcare
#   Routes API             — real drive/walk times
#
# Restrict by IP (server-side use only). This key must not be exposed to the
# browser; the app reaches Google through this server's /api/* routes.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Domain Developer Portal — the source of real listings, pricing and tenure.
# Create a project at https://developer.domain.com.au and copy its OAuth2
# client credentials. New projects get Agents & Listings and Properties &
# Locations immediately; Suburb Performance and Demographics may need adding.
#
# Auth is client_credentials against https://auth.domain.com.au/v1/connect/token
# Scopes used: api_listings_read api_properties_read
#              api_suburbperformance_read api_demographics_read
# A scope outside your plan returns 400 invalid_scope.
DOMAIN_CLIENT_ID=
DOMAIN_CLIENT_SECRET=

# PropTrack (REA Group) is not self-serve — it needs a commercial agreement,
# so there is no adapter here. Contact them before planning around it.
# PROPTRACK_CLIENT_ID=
# PROPTRACK_CLIENT_SECRET=
